{"unit_id":"yepyeel__dsh-prompt-suggestion#card-zh","repo":"yepyeel/dsh-prompt-suggestion","commit":"929eef913566ae89cc4b3c67177872e792606414","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestion 是面向 DSH Web 和 Desktop 的输入预测插件：助手完成一轮回复后，它调用当前会话模型生成下一句草稿，并以输入框中的灰色 ghost 文本呈现。用户可用 Tab 或方向键采纳，也可忽略；草稿不会直接发送。插件提供自动预测、手动生成、按会话控制、模型选择、上下文条数和提示词设置，适合希望更快续写对话的 DSH 用户。需要一个可用的 DSH 模型 provider。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:1-43","src/host/index.ts:1-20","src/host/suggestion-service.ts:15-78"]}
{"unit_id":"yepyeel__dsh-prompt-suggestion#card-en","repo":"yepyeel/dsh-prompt-suggestion","commit":"929eef913566ae89cc4b3c67177872e792606414","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestion predicts a next message in the DSH composer. After an assistant turn, it asks the session model for a draft and shows gray ghost text. Accept with Tab or dismiss it; it is never sent automatically. Supports manual suggestions, per-session controls and model selection.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:1-43","src/host/index.ts:1-20","src/host/suggestion-service.ts:15-78"]}
